		{
			dependencies: ["2541F19B9838484F"]
			description: [
				"While the regular furnace is enough for the cooking of most lazy card holders embarked on their journey, there is a certain sense of satisfaction that comes with properly cooking a meal."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The stove effectively serves as a larger campfire, being able to cook two more items at once."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The skillet can be used as a portable cooking device or as a regular kitchen utensil. You can either place down a skillet on a fire, campfire, or stove to start cooking with it, or hold both raw meat and a skillet in hand while using one of the fire sources noted above to start the cooking process. It also doubles as a weapon with severe knockback."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The cooking pot is made to prepare more elaborate meal options. Some recipes, such as soup, also require a bowl for food to be served."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "7363621391F2E8EC"
			rewards: [{
				id: "1E979AAB5CD387B0"
