		{
			dependencies: ["1203CDC5DF26F779"]
			description: [
				"Crop rotation is an important mastery of the land. Different crops growing next to each other will grow faster than everything neatly arranged in a single line, as they will naturally coexist and mutually benefit each other in symbiosis."
				""
				"To truly learn the ways of the plant, we may plant one of each crop at least once in our lives. Then, we can finally learn the power of four hundredfold saturation."
			]
