		{
			dependencies: ["1203CDC5DF26F779"]
			description: [
				"The Tomato is a wonderful fruit. Or is it a vegetable? Out of the produce I've come across on my travels, its global versatility is unparalleled—peeled, sliced, sautéed, or raw, tomatoes enhance dishes from pizzas to stews. "
