			dependencies: ["7D347AB89C552DDA"]
			description: ["The automation of food processes was a great boon to humanity, although not widespread in all parts of the world yet. I did not meet such a person well-versed in the arts of the food industry, but I can make my reasonable guesses that this would have to be someone of both the Hermit and Empress Pathways."]
