		{
			dependencies: ["6B9C854C208F6A93"]
			description: [
				"On my travels to the East, this delicacy was one that had spread as far as the West goes. Despite using a simple staple crop, it manages to turn the annoying kelp we find around oceans into something edible."
				""
				"While dining at a high-end kelp roll shop in the middle of a river, I was offered my first high-quality cutting board - the same one I still use to cut the very rolls I crave every night."
			]
