		{
			dependencies: ["4E912C726E35BFB0"]
			description: [
				"The humble pumpkin pie is one of the contenders in a great war over food. The advocates of the golden carrot pledge that their preferred food is the most optimal. Pumpkin pie isn't even second to the golden carrot. "
				""
				"However, it can easily be mass-produced for minimal effort once the setup is ready. There are plenty of cheap pumpkin pie slices sold in stalls and in general stores."
			]
