		{
			dependencies: ["7D347AB89C552DDA"]
			description: [
				"This girl I had met was intrigued by me the most of all travelers and invited me in and offered me a holiday candy. Although the recipe was long lost to most, she had some pieces of a recipe book she could try to use. One day, she had done it, but she never published the fruits of her cuisine. She did it not for glory, money, or out of tradition. She did it because she wanted to be the only one who knew how."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"I kept one of the candies and managed to pin down the recipe after many nights licking small torn-off parts of a holiday candy."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "2345602C410E1787"
			rewards: [{
