		{
			dependencies: ["2345602C410E1787"]
			description: [
				"The coffee candy and the shiny eclair both make great use of chocolate to provide a rush of energy to their users. Sadly, with the size of these treats, this boost is very temporary, lasting a dozen seconds or so. "
				""
				"This did not stop athletes from eating some of these coffee candies in a hurry or miners from splurging on an eclair every once in a while."
