		{
			dependencies: ["1203CDC5DF26F779"]
			description: [
				"Various special candies can be found either around the world or held by the undead - the recipe long forgotten and their powers desired. All of the Death card holders I've met were practically hunting anything that did not live and kept looking under carved pumpkins for candy."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"I met a girl on my travels in a small, obscure town in the autumn countryside who had claimed the recipe of some candies from her grandmother and reverse-engineered it to give it mystical power."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"She spoke of her grandmother, who once served a powerful vampire lord; the only thing missing in his life was sugar and spice. Legends say that he tasked one of his chefs and one of his mages with creating a mystical candy that even a vampire would crave. This girl that I met was the granddaughter of an apprentice of an apprentice of one of these chefs."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "7D347AB89C552DDA"
			rewards: [{
				count: 9
