		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4E912C726E35BFB0"]
			description: ["I enter a fancy-looking but desolate restaurant in Sparkon named \"L'Honey Home\". It's the most deserted restaurant in the city, but I have faith. Oddly, there is no menu as bees fly around the small shop. I am handed a bottle of honey. Curious, I ask what this is. They recognize I am not from here, and explain that this is a honeyed drink, sweet and nearly as nutritious as a meal. Well, not enough to replace it, which is why they also serve some sweet bread with it."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
