		{
			dependencies: ["6B9C854C208F6A93"]
			description: ["I was surprised to find that this engineer living in his windmill subsisted entirely on mushrooms. He ground down mushrooms he had grown in great quantities, at first through the use of colonies and then through artificial processes, to then suck them down as a very nutritious paste. It tasted terrible, but it had clearly sustained him and his friends long enough to pass on the recipe. I do not want to write it down."]
