		{
			dependencies: ["5B6678771CE97E00"]
			description: ["Did I mention I enjoy lamb and mutton? Oh yes, I did. It is quite a tender and juicy meat when cooked perfectly. Shepherd's pie is quite the mix between a simple and fancy meal but is most savoury when fresh. This isn't often the case though, as I tend to use fresh mutton for other recipes."]
