		{
			dependencies: ["7C08CDE9CCF30255"]
			description: [
				"The chocolate pies of Reon were so renowned throughout the world that I just had to go out of my way on my journey to visit the City of Chocolate."
				""
				"Historically, the first batch of cocoa arrived at the port city of Reon in the middle of a continent-spanning war. As enemy fleets clashed on the coast, the inhabitants of Reon rejoiced in figuring out how to process chocolate. Their joy was short-lived and turned to contempt and hatred as their rivals in Parlan invented hot chocolate."
