				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The Caramel Square combos nicely with the mint apple, as you might feel a sharp pain in your guts from eating the mint apple. Might as well finish the clogging of your arteries. Wait, you're not meant to swallow the entire caramelized apple in one go?"
